## About

This project implements a **stateless token-based authentication system** using JSON Web Tokens (JWT) in a Node.js/Express backend. It covers:

- User **registration** with bcrypt password hashing
- User **login** that returns a signed JWT
- A **protected route** accessible only with a valid token
- A public **user listing** endpoint (homework extension)

---

## Project Structure

```
node-token-auth/
├── server.js                 # Entry point — registers routes and starts server
├── .env                      # Secret key and port (never commit this!)
├── routes/
│   ├── auth.js               # POST /auth/register, POST /auth/login, GET /auth/users
│   └── protected.js          # GET /profile (protected route)
└── middleware/
    └── verifyToken.js        # JWT verification middleware
```

---

## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org) installed (v14 or higher)
- VS Code with [Thunder Client](https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=rangav.vscode-thunder-client) extension

### Installation

```bash
# 1. Clone or create the project folder
mkdir node-token-auth
cd node-token-auth

# 2. Initialise Node project
npm init -y

# 3. Install dependencies
npm install express jsonwebtoken bcryptjs dotenv

# 4. Create folders
mkdir routes middleware
```

### Environment Setup

Create a `.env` file in the root directory:

```env
JWT_SECRET=supersecretkey123
PORT=3000
```

> ⚠️ **Never commit `.env` to GitHub.** Add it to `.gitignore`.

### Run the Server

```bash
node server.js
```

```
Server running on http://localhost:3000

Available endpoints:
  POST /auth/register  - Create account
  POST /auth/login     - Login and get token
  GET  /profile        - Protected route (needs token)
```

---

## API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Auth Required | Description |
|--------|----------|:-------------:|-------------|
| `POST` | `/auth/register` | ❌ | Register a new user |
| `POST` | `/auth/login` | ❌ | Login and receive JWT |
| `GET` | `/profile` | ✅ Bearer Token | Access protected user profile |
| `GET` | `/auth/users` | ❌ | List all users (id, name, email only) |

### Request & Response Examples

#### POST `/auth/register`
```json
// Request Body
{
  "name": "Alice",
  "email": "alice@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

// Response 201
{
  "message": "User registered successfully!"
}
```

#### POST `/auth/login`
```json
// Request Body
{
  "email": "alice@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

// Response 200
{
  "message": "Login successful!",
  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..."
}
```

#### GET `/profile`
```
// Header
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
```
```json
// Response 200
{
  "message": "Welcome! You accessed a protected route.",
  "user": {
    "id": 1,
    "email": "alice@test.com",
    "iat": 1715000000,
    "exp": 1715086400
  }
}
```

#### GET `/auth/users`
```json
// Response 200
[
  { "id": 1, "name": "Alice", "email": "alice@test.com" },
  { "id": 2, "name": "Bob", "email": "bob@test.com" }
]
```

